              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lucy Shakeshaft"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just made this cake, smells amazing! It was easy to prepare aswell. I was worried about the cookie dough texture until I folded in the egg whites which made the batter smooth. I won't be doing the glaze this time as I need to transport it to work!",
